    "headline": "A mitigation package, not a headline target",
    "points": [
      {
        "k": "Temperature",
        "v": "Accepts 1.5°C is likely to be exceeded; backs an overshoot-peak-decline pathway to return below 1.5°C by 2100."
      },
      {
        "k": "NDCs",
        "v": "Effective implementation of national plans and urgent submission of missing NDCs."
      },
      {
        "k": "Energy",
        "v": "Deliver the first global stocktake: transition away from fossil fuels and an accelerated clean energy transition, with clean electrification central."
      },
      {
        "k": "Mitigation track",
        "v": "Space in the talks for mitigation and a steer for the second global stocktake. Reuters reports the EU wants the mitigation work programme extended to 2040."
      },
      {
        "k": "Resilience",
        "v": "Mitigation and adaptation treated as complementary; resilience a prerequisite for prosperity."
